From 11da6fdced8886085fc85abdb2eb5578a8e1033a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:15:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateless H.264 decoding

Add H264_SLICE decoding with multi-instance firmware and direct VLD
input. Translate request controls into firmware picture and reference
state, including field references and weighted prediction. Keep parser
and reference-list scratch out of kernel stack frames. Refuse CAVLC
slice prefixes that overlap encoded macroblock data.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
